{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Kingdom Flipper",
    "steam_appid": 2423020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/46912a33059b7de9317b308b562a60d3.poster.avif?t=1752610863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/46912a33059b7de9317b308b562a60d3.webm?t=1752610863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the king\u2019s newest architect! Don\u2019t worry about what happened to the one before - it\u2019s your time to shine as the latest peasant to flip castles in the name of His Majesty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/739ef6a946963c2ead5885763c671dfe.poster.avif?t=1752610863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/739ef6a946963c2ead5885763c671dfe.webm?t=1752610863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take drab huts and turn them into sprawling castles, fortresses and much more! Give new life to old stones by cleaning, repairing, rebuilding, painting and decorating medieval era buildings. Then flip them for profit!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/8b2373608df57ec4bc87312c5161b867.poster.avif?t=1752610863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/8b2373608df57ec4bc87312c5161b867.webm?t=1752610863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who says castles have to be gray? Unleash your creativity on vast castles and strongholds. Experiment in Creative Mode or your own home fortress and create your dream castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/bbfa429dd679ec006fac16a4a587254b.poster.avif?t=1752610863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/bbfa429dd679ec006fac16a4a587254b.webm?t=1752610863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t stay a lowly architect and make that coin! Take on royal jobs around the kingdom and build up your coffers to flip even bigger, grander castles.  Gather skill points and spend them on a variety of skills from cleaning to crafting and become a master architect your way.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/46912a33059b7de9317b308b562a60d3.poster.avif?t=1752610863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/46912a33059b7de9317b308b562a60d3.webm?t=1752610863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the king\u2019s newest architect! Don\u2019t worry about what happened to the one before - it\u2019s your time to shine as the latest peasant to flip castles in the name of His Majesty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/739ef6a946963c2ead5885763c671dfe.poster.avif?t=1752610863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/739ef6a946963c2ead5885763c671dfe.webm?t=1752610863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take drab huts and turn them into sprawling castles, fortresses and much more! Give new life to old stones by cleaning, repairing, rebuilding, painting and decorating medieval era buildings. Then flip them for profit!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/8b2373608df57ec4bc87312c5161b867.poster.avif?t=1752610863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/8b2373608df57ec4bc87312c5161b867.webm?t=1752610863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who says castles have to be gray? Unleash your creativity on vast castles and strongholds. Experiment in Creative Mode or your own home fortress and create your dream castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/bbfa429dd679ec006fac16a4a587254b.poster.avif?t=1752610863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/bbfa429dd679ec006fac16a4a587254b.webm?t=1752610863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t stay a lowly architect and make that coin! Take on royal jobs around the kingdom and build up your coffers to flip even bigger, grander castles.  Gather skill points and spend them on a variety of skills from cleaning to crafting and become a master architect your way.</p>",
    "short_description": "Peasants your time has come! Grab a broom and hammer, it\u2019s time to flip castles! Take drab strongholds and transform them into palaces fit for royalty. Take jobs, buy land, and build your dream castle all for profit, of course!",
